@1 = ~I'm afraid we trusted the wrong ally here, <CHARNAME>. We should weigh the risks and reconsider who we are following. This Shandalar does not strike me as an honorable person anymore.~
@2 = ~(Hmph! A war that bleeds both Halruaa and the Sword Coast dry? Splendid!) I see no reason to abandon Shandalar just yet, fool. Think of the boundless profits! If we play our cards correctly, we might secure the skyship blueprints for ourselves. (Imagine the glory when Edwin Odesseiron delivers the secrets of flight to the High Wizards of Thay! They would grovel at my feet!)~
@3 = ~Hah! I like this Shandalar more by the minute. Cruel, opportunistic, and thoroughly ruthless. That's a man after my own heart. Let's finish the job and get paid.~
@4 = ~I strongly urge you to heed the gnome's words, <CHARNAME>. If this tale holds true, we are not allies to this wizard—we are merely cattle being led to his slaughterhouse.~
@5 = ~He is not wise to involve outsiders in his own conspiracies. I urge thee to think before making a rushed decision.~
